# T-0029: Close priority-1 source-family cells for the 16 depth-5 people on Kristina's side

## Context

After consolidation, the remaining measure gap at depth 5 on Kristina's side is
source breadth: `goal-state --depth=5` lists open priority-1 cells (`1`)
per person in `genealogy/source-coverage.md`. Under the north star a person
is source-broad when every relevant family is used, negatively bounded,
access-blocked, conditional or explicitly irrelevant.

## Acceptance Criteria

- [x] No depth-5 person on side K has a `1` cell left; each former `1`
  became `✓`, `N`, `S`, `2` or `—` with the disposition recorded in the
  dossier and research log.
- [x] Any new observations were preserved under the evidence model with
  citations and checksums; no new relative or biographical fact arose.
- [x] `goal-state --depth=5` shows side K coverageReady = 16.

